<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67626" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηχᾰν-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>resourceful, inventive</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				4.3.1
			</span></i>, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HG</u>
				3.1.8
			</span></i>. Adv. -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					18.27
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. gen. rei, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἐπιτηδείων -ώτερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Lac.</u>
					2.7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>of</i> or <i>for machines, mechanical</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄργανα μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1336a11
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ . . κινήσεις αἱ μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Mech.</u>
					848a14
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. ἀποδείξεις</span>
			<i>in mechanics</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>APo.</u>
				76a24
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηχανικά, τά</span>, <i>the science of mechanics</i>, title
			of work ascribed to Aristotle: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ
			-κή</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνη</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1078a16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.807
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. ποίημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sotad.
					15.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. ἔργα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PFlor.</u>
					152.4
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>: Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηχανικός, ὁ</span>, <i>engineer</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Per.</u>
				27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sammelb.</u>
				310
			</span></i>. Adv. -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Callix.
					2
				</span></i>
			.</div>
